        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magecraft: Spellbuilding</strong> is a deckbuilder with a focus on crafting your own spell cards and creating unique decks to take with you into the turn-based combat of the Dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you have control over the cards you start with, the randomized Dungeon layouts, enemy encounters, passive powers, and scrolls ensure that no two runs are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/549ee2cee68f7aa4de0b56bf6f20066b.avif?t=1757677874\" width=616 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/018e54a6480253ea663e10d1221171b7.webp?t=1757677874\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/c9181341e0e166882166514e070324ca.poster.avif?t=1757677874\" width=640 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/c9181341e0e166882166514e070324ca.webm?t=1757677874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/c9181341e0e166882166514e070324ca.mp4?t=1757677874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on enemy attacks, destroying them to keep yourself safe from harm - or take the hit and attack enemies directly to do as much damage as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/