ass=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/74cc3fb3b87d7661b4bc5197ff6d0175.webp?t=1757677874\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/64c04449ae419f53c6391b59f4cc5944.apng?t=1757677874\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/64c04449ae419f53c6391b59f4cc5944.poster.avif?t=1757677874\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=250 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between a variety of appearances, color palettes, and unique Background powers when creating a character - and unlock new character colors to change into, as well as new characters with powerful abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/14cfce88f8bf50fdd63f7d3bfec7d384.webp?t=1757677874\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/c628dc6e3450dd5e72a8eb439728a2bc.poster.avif?t=1757677874\" width=586 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/c628dc6e3450dd5e72a8eb439728a2bc.webm?t=1757677874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/c628dc6e3450dd5e72a8eb439728a2bc.mp4?t=1757677874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Abyss is a separate  mode with randomized characters and starting decks, where unlike the main game, dying means starting a new run from the very beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
